phrase: check step changes between consecutive elements under {max_diff}
slot: max_diff int
test: list=2,4,7,9 max_diff=3
expect: => i=4 r=0.0 ok=true s="validated running steps: 4" errors=0 n=4 res=[2,4,7,9] cache=0 hits=0
